WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.093 --> 00:00:09.589
An old sage was meditating alone.

2
00:00:09.590 --> 00:00:14.918
Suddenly lightning flashed brightly in his mind.

3
00:00:14.919 --> 00:00:20.208
He saw a blue dragon flying high above the land.

4
00:00:20.209 --> 00:00:25.988
"Ha-ha-ha!" A boy rode on its back, laughing.

5
00:00:25.989 --> 00:00:32.509
The dragon shot straight toward the palace.

6
00:00:32.510 --> 00:00:36.891
The sage stood up, shaking.

7
00:00:36.892 --> 00:00:40.876
"That was a troubling vision," he thought.

8
00:00:40.877 --> 00:00:45.054
"The boy on the dragon is a threat to the kingdom.

9
00:00:45.055 --> 00:00:52.984
I must speak to the king right away!"

10
00:00:52.985 --> 00:00:57.056
Police Chief Heup bowed to the king.

11
00:00:57.057 --> 00:01:02.452
"Your Majesty, a temple in Hapcheon was robbed," he said.

12
00:01:02.453 --> 00:01:04.491
The king frowned.

13
00:01:04.492 --> 00:01:12.289
"Why are you bothering me with such small matters?"

14
00:01:12.290 --> 00:01:17.947
Just then an old sage appeared and bowed.

15
00:01:17.948 --> 00:01:22.362
"I had a terrible vision, Your Majesty."

16
00:01:22.363 --> 00:01:28.278
The sage told the king about the boy and the dragon.

17
00:01:28.279 --> 00:01:35.092
"The boy will cause trouble in the kingdom! You must do something."

18
00:01:35.093 --> 00:01:43.591
The king laughed. "You all worry too much over little things.

19
00:01:43.592 --> 00:01:53.087
I'm the king. No one would dare challenge me."

20
00:01:53.088 --> 00:01:56.903
After robbing the temple, the bandits lived well.

21
00:01:56.904 --> 00:02:00.717
They didn't need to go out every day to steal.

22
00:02:00.718 --> 00:02:06.076
Everyone was happy, except Gildong.

23
00:02:06.077 --> 00:02:09.551
"I left home to find my own destiny.

24
00:02:09.552 --> 00:02:13.473
But now I'm leading a group of thieves," he thought.

25
00:02:13.474 --> 00:02:16.933
His father's words rang in his ears.

26
00:02:16.934 --> 00:02:21.561
"Always remember to do good in the world."

27
00:02:21.562 --> 00:02:26.330
"So, boss," Mok said, interrupting Gildong's thoughts.

28
00:02:26.331 --> 00:02:29.919
"What should we rob next?"

29
00:02:29.920 --> 00:02:33.793
"We shouldn't steal again anytime soon," Gildong said.

30
00:02:33.794 --> 00:02:36.654
"Soldiers are probably still searching for us.

31
00:02:36.655 --> 00:02:40.170
And the stuff we stole will last us a long time."

32
00:02:40.171 --> 00:02:47.566
Mok smiled. "I'm glad we have a smart leader like you."

33
00:02:47.567 --> 00:02:52.090
A thief named Chibong brought a small boy over.

34
00:02:52.091 --> 00:02:56.294
"I found him by our storehouse," Chibong said.

35
00:02:56.295 --> 00:03:01.856
Mok stomped his foot. "You little thief!"

36
00:03:01.857 --> 00:03:07.837
The boy burst into tears.

37
00:03:07.838 --> 00:03:10.531
"I didn't steal anything.

38
00:03:10.532 --> 00:03:14.113
I was looking for food for me and my sister.

39
00:03:14.114 --> 00:03:20.608
Our parents died, so we're all alone."

40
00:03:20.609 --> 00:03:25.873
Gildong looked at the boy. He was thin and dirty.

41
00:03:25.874 --> 00:03:29.629
"What's your name?" Gildong asked softly.

42
00:03:29.630 --> 00:03:32.932
"Boknam," the boy said.

43
00:03:32.933 --> 00:03:38.192
"What should we do with this thief?" Chibong asked.

44
00:03:38.193 --> 00:03:43.374
Nabi frowned. "He's just a hungry boy."

45
00:03:43.375 --> 00:03:48.526
"Besides, we stole our food too," Gildong said.

46
00:03:48.527 --> 00:03:53.944
At that, Mok and Chibong stopped scowling.

47
00:03:53.945 --> 00:04:00.101
"Give him a bowl of rice.

48
00:04:00.102 --> 00:04:03.209
He can stay here tonight," Gildong said.

49
00:04:03.210 --> 00:04:06.339
"We've got so much food.

50
00:04:06.340 --> 00:04:10.770
Let's take some down to the people in town tomorrow."

51
00:04:10.771 --> 00:04:14.972
Boknam wiped his tears. "Thank you!"

52
00:04:14.973 --> 00:04:24.914
Gildong smiled at the boy. "You're welcome."

